OL,3,AMurder arrests over baby girl's death
OL,4,Ain woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a baby was
OL,8,Ffound dead while camping with her
OL,9,Ffamily in Staffordshire.
OL,11,FThe three-month-old girl died after
OL,12,Femergency services were called to
OL,13,Freports of a child in cardiac arrest in
OL,14,Fwoodland off Strawberry Lane, near
OL,15,FCheslyn Hay, at 08:45 BST on Saturday.
OL,17,FThe people arrested were a 42-year-old
OL,18,Fman and 30-year-old woman from south
OL,19,FStaffordshire, a 20-year-old woman from
OL,20,FWolverhampton and an 18-year-old man
OL,21,Ffrom Walsall.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
